{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6c9c6e35-cbf1-4fca-aec8-11abd6a40819","agentId":"a320534075171177a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Work on GitHub issue #8 using the hq-work skill (.claude/skills/hq-work/SKILL.md, AGENTS.md). The human explicitly assigned it (it says human task; they approved agent help for the docs only). Scope: docs/hack/BRIEF.md \"Hour-one sign-ups\" only; never touch .env or secrets and never print values. Record status from what the human told me on 2026-11-14: DONE: ElevenLabs key; MongoDB Atlas cluster and org API key; Tiger Cloud service; Solana RPC and keypair (devnet for the demo, mainnet for the real app, see docs/DECISIONS.md); Gemini key on the FREE tier (not paid; use only our own test clips); Apple developer account (the Watch signing result is not known; do not claim one). All keys live in a 1Password Environment, not committed. SKIPPED on purpose: Street Manager registration (use the recorded sample of Newcastle permits, #67), hotel affiliate network (OpenStreetMap hotels with placeholder booking links), Vultr API key (live deploy is the Cloudflare tunnel at kip.edenmatrix.xyz; Vultr is only an alternative). Keep edits small, no em dashes, match the file's style. Claim with ./hq claim 8 --agent claude. Run ./hq check (note: a local .env.local may make one speak test fail; if that is the only failure, say so and rely on CI). Open the PR with ./hq pr 8 --agent claude --body-file .context/pr-8.md (add --allow-dirty only if the sole dirt is an untracked apps/mobile/.gitignore you did not make). Commit signing works now; never use --no-gpg-sign. Do the Entire trail steps per AGENTS.md (report a 409, do not retry). Do NOT merge. Final report under 80 words with the PR number."},"uuid":"e1d4783f-c060-46dc-9abd-0cd84b59766d","timestamp":"2026-11-14T22:54:53.290Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/Users/nick/conductor/repos/durhack-proj/.claude/worktrees/agent-a320534075171177a","sessionI